@host = http://localhost:5000

### Health probe
GET {{host}}/health

### Create a promotion (persists to Cosmos, publishes to Service Bus + Event Grid)
POST {{host}}/api/promotions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "region": "US",
  "name": "Weekend 20% Off",
  "type": 0,
  "discountValue": 20,
  "startDate": "2026-06-20T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-06-22T00:00:00Z",
  "storeIds": ["S001", "S002", "S003"],
  "applicableProducts": ["SKU123", "SKU456"],
  "minimumCartValue": 50,
  "createdBy": "marketing@contoso.com"
}

### List a region's promotions (single-partition Cosmos query)
GET {{host}}/api/promotions?region=US

### Get one promotion (point read)
GET {{host}}/api/promotions/REPLACE_ID?region=US

### Activate (publishes events + queues catalog rebuild job)
POST {{host}}/api/promotions/REPLACE_ID/activate?region=US

### Register a device for push notifications (Notification Hubs)
POST {{host}}/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "fcm",
  "pushHandle": "fcm-device-token-here",
  "tags": ["region:US", "store:S001"]
}

### Stream a POS redemption (Event Hubs telemetry)
POST {{host}}/api/redemptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promotionId": "REPLACE_ID",
  "storeId": "S001",
  "region": "US",
  "discountApplied": 12.50,
  "cartValue": 62.50
}
